{
  "_note": "JSE stdlib fill wave — the JS core-library floor. Pins: String repeat/substring/lastIndexOf/trimStart/trimEnd/charAt/charCodeAt/codePointAt/normalize (grapheme-indexed like every JSE string op; charCodeAt/codePointAt return the CODE POINT of the i-th grapheme's first scalar — JSE exposes no UTF-16 halves) and matchAll (g-semantics, arrays of match arrays); Array lastIndexOf/fill/toSorted/toReversed/with/toSpliced/entries/keys/values + findLast/findLastIndex/reduceRight and the flat(Infinity) full-flatten; Number toFixed (half-away-from-zero on the scaled double, identical on all three kernels) and the STRICT Number.is* statics (no coercion); String.fromCharCode / Array.of / Object.hasOwn; the Math fill (atan + inverse/hyperbolic trig, log1p/expm1, fround/clz32/imul); Date UTC getters + Date.UTC (TZ-independent) — Date SETTERS are statement-position mutations (the actions corpus pins them, like every core-object mutation).",
